THIRD-PARTY NOTICES AND LICENSES
================================

This repository redistributes a static "Time Zone Picker" web page that is built on
top of several third-party open-source components and data sets. Each retains its own
license. This project claims no ownership over those components; the notices below are
provided to comply with their license terms.

The original picker UI is based on an open-source Leaflet time-zone picker; credit to
its authors.

